Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:49.77,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}mugendai no chizu hiroge{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Towards the place that has no end{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:52.90,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}hateshinai ano basho e{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Have the courage to take a step forward{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:57.61,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}fumidase yuuki no ippo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:02:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Raise your fist{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:02:01.78,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}ko wo agete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell Kin'emon-{\i1}kun{\i0} and the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That we'll fight along with you at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kin'emon... {\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad to see you two, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.78,0:02:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, it's getting busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There are tons of people\Nwho won't last the week before the great battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.49,0:02:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So if you'll excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.00,0:02:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you're pretty exhausted, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll repeat myself over and over again\Nuntil you believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.65,0:03:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am the great thief Ushimitsu Kozo\Nwho created turmoil in the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shut up! If you're really him,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.45,0:03:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,why did you appear around midnight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't laugh! You're taking me for a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You won't get out of here alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. No wonder we did not notice...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"Shaking the Nation!\NThe Identity of Ushimitsu Kozo The Chivalrous Thief!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Big news! Big news!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The great thief Ushimitsu Kozo...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:15.42,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,FLOWER CAPITAL
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.67,0:04:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...who caused trouble \Nin the Flower Capital...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...finally got caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.67,0:04:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,His number is finally up...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Special report! Special report!\NThere's big news!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ushimitsu Kozo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0},\Nthere is something that I want you to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's about Ushimitsu Kozo\Nwho we caught yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.95,0:04:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,None of you can understand the pain of\Nlosing a beloved woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:05:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,About the Oiran, Komurasaki's death,\Nmy sympathies are with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But with all due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kyoshiro's move was wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If he let someone\Nwho stood against you walk away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,it would have undermined\Nyour authority and reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.33,0:05:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I do not care about Ushimitsu Kozo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There is no other woman as beautiful as Komurasaki\Nin the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.27,0:05:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you see that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is so great to see you, Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.19,0:05:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:06:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ushimitsu Kozo was not \Njust another petty thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.27,0:06:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ushimitsu Kozo, the cowardly burglar\Nwho caused trouble in the Flower Capital...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.03,0:06:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He is a hero-wannabe, small-time \Ncrook who gives away
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.67,0:06:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,the money and goods he steals to poor people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We are holding him at the Prisoners' Quarters\Nin Rasetsu Town,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but the truth is his identity is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.65,0:06:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-He is... alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way... I cannot believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.41,0:06:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:07:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you are from the Kurozumi Family.\NWhy didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.13,0:07:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He is... He is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.01,0:07:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lord! Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.47,0:07:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should we do about Ushimitsu Kozo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.65,0:07:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you need to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Execute him! And show it to public\Nto set an example!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Illuminate the Light-Scrolls across the Land of Wano\Nimmediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Light-Scrolls are already prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.01,0:07:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kyoshiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.47,0:07:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Today, Komurasaki's funeral will be held\Nin the Flower Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We are expecting a crowd of people\Nand it will be chaotic...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.89,0:07:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That is why we have already prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:07:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my Kyoshiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! This is what we are going to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We will let Ushimitsu Kozo\Nfollow Komurasaki to the grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.82,0:08:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To accompany her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.12,0:08:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a pity to lose the two biggest stars of the capital\Nat the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Only you could come up \Nwith such a nice idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will be there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will witness his execution to the end!\NI need a palanquin now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.22,0:08:42.68,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,EXCAVATION LABOR CAMP, UDON
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.43,0:08:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop making bad jokes\Nso early in the morning, Kaido-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's not a joke!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Word came from the Flower Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Komurasaki died!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.59,0:09:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She died!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If you think it's a lie,\Nhook up your Light-Scroll Snail!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! No...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Komurasaki-{\i1}tan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.85,0:09:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He found out that Komurasaki died!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.38,0:09:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure that he'll be in \Na bad mood for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're in trouble. What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.03,0:09:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.03,0:09:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.83,0:09:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! No time for that now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, balloon!\NCan we start today's sumo match already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.68,0:10:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you idiots gain weight from yesterday?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, we didn't! It's just your imagination!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.73,0:10:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--O-Okay.\N--Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.79,0:10:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Forget it!\N--Should we tell him that the red-bean soup is all gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! Another shock could drive him mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I wonder where the red-bean soup went...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That is why I told Luffy-{\i1}dono \{\i0}Nnot to eat too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eating up all the soup in the pot\Nwas too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How can an idiot like him survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's just have the sumo match!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! {\i1}Dosukoi{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is no time for dealing with a fool!\NI have to find out the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Let me see the Flower Capital now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.29,0:10:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get the Light-Scroll Snail ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.57,0:10:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Light-Scroll Snail has been set up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Connect it to the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.32,0:11:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it a Video Transponder Snail?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.58,0:11:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? That must be the Flower Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:18.80,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,ATAMAYAMA, KURI
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.73,0:11:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe they are attacking Atamayama!\NScrew them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.41,0:11:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shutenmaru, this is it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is my revenge!\NI'll make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.03,0:12:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn you Atamayama Thieves Brigade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.58,0:12:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you steal all \Nof my food and weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:29.28,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,THE ATAMAYAMA THIEVES BRIGADE WAS HERE\NSHUTENMARU
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Holdem-{\i1}sama{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't forgive you, Shutenmaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.39,0:12:50.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll smash you fools to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.97,0:12:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's hysterical! What can you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.35,0:13:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't expect stealing food and weapons\Nwould cause this much trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Duke-{\i1}sama{\i0}! Kin-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whew!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.07,0:13:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We stole so much.\NFood... And weapons from the factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice work. Did you leave the note?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:56.87,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,THE ATAMAYAMA THIEVES BRIGADE WAS HERE\NSHUTENMARU
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:14:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are we responsible for this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.06,0:14:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is part of Kin-{\i1}san{\i0}'s plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Watch closely!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not just the food and the weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.48,0:14:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--You coward!\N--What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.27,0:14:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't play innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your subordinate made such a ruckus in Bakura Town\Nand messed me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Red Hawk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! What are you talking about?!\NI had nothing to do with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you pretending that you don't know?\NAll right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.31,0:14:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's just sort it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.77,0:15:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this Trick Mechanism Sword's attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.99,0:15:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your cheap trick won't work on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.18,0:15:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah? Then, I'll increase the heat!\NKamijiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at this fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.01,0:15:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you that your cheap trick won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.15,0:15:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fight me fairly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't you noticed yet? Look around you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.23,0:15:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You see? The fire has \Nspread in all directions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.74,0:15:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why would I even bother \Nfighting you head-on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here to destroy Atamayama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.13,0:16:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Our Atamayama...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.43,0:16:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forget about Holdem for now!\NLet's retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.73,0:16:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shutenmaru's hideout has been destroyed!\NThey no longer have a place to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the end of the \NAtamayama Thieves Brigade!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Too late! The fire's spreading too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's impossible to extinguish \Nit, Shutenmaru-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.30,0:16:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn Holdem!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go to Bakura Town!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bakura Town?!\NKaido's army will come after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.15,0:17:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll kick all of their asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way... This can't be happening...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.32,0:17:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We didn't plan for this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.16,0:17:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's notify Duke-{\i1}sama{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:24.71,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,AN ABANDONED VILLAGE, KURI
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see... I feel sorry for Ashura Doji.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.67,0:17:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mm-hm... But we did it for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.67,0:17:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It cannot be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.80,0:17:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go to Bakura Town!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Our plan is foiled\Nand we do not know what to do yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.47,0:17:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But for the time being, we need Ashura to be\Nhostile towards the Animal Kingdom Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.31,0:17:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because we definitely need him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:58.28,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,NORTHERN GRAVEYARD, RINGO
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.53,0:18:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe Nami-{\i1}san{\i0} and the others\Nhave come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.29,0:18:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?! What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.35,0:18:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-W-What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.68,0:18:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Brook... What's up with you?\NWhy are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zoro-{\i1}san{\i0}!\NYou're almost making my eyes pop out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, if I had eyes to begin with!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.27,0:18:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry to interrupt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.32,0:18:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you got the wrong idea! Come back in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.26,0:18:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Oh, okay... If you say so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, how beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.75,0:18:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, but may I see your panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.32,0:19:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! He's safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry. A curse on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.06,0:19:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.69,0:19:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kin'emon-{\i1}san{\i0} told me to\Nstay here and say that to people...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.42,0:19:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...there are so many offerings out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.62,0:19:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I can't believe that\Nyou're Momonosuke-{\i1}san{\i0}'s sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.34,0:19:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're as lovely as the Oirans!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course! Because she's an Oiran!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It must be so nice to have someone like her by your side.\NI wish I were you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.39,0:19:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was just sleeping, but she...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry! I thought you were really cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.28,0:19:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I always make men drool\Nwhenever I sleep alongside them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.65,0:20:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you like it? Well, I know you loved it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.38,0:20:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--You're pretty straightforward...\N--Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I wonder where\NNami-{\i1}san{\i0} and the others are...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They went to a bathhouse yesterday,\Nso I tried to go meet them, but I couldn't find them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.84,0:20:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, by the way, the Flower Capital is\Nin total chaos now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.25,0:20:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Today is the funeral of Komurasaki-{\i1}san{\i0} the Oiran,\Nthe most beautiful woman in the Land of Wano...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On top of that, Ushimitsu Kozo the great thief\Nwho spread the money he stole to the poor got caught,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.19,0:20:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and that's causing a fuss, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ushimitsu Kozo got caught?! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.40,0:20:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.58,0:20:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, it's written in the broadsheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll be executed in the capital today...\NAnd they found out his identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:46.37,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,USHIMITSU KOZO GOT CAUGHT
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.75,0:20:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think he's popular in Ebisu Town...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.74,0:20:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You said Ebisu Town?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.43,0:20:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. And his name is, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.93,0:20:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Yasu-something...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:20:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonoyasu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.25,0:21:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, that's the name!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.63,0:21:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toko!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.23,0:21:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! What's the matter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.79,0:21:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Toko!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.73,0:21:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for saving us yesterday!\NWe will not forget your kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.57,0:21:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You couldn't protect her yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! I've just come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.95,0:21:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.47,0:21:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.60,0:21:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you came to escort me?\NThat's very generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.70,0:22:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,N-No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.08,0:22:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That man is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.59,0:22:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where do you think you're going?!\NYour life is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.01,0:22:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.43,0:22:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.45,0:22:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Get yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.89,0:22:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.37,0:22:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toko!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.50,0:22:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.98,0:22:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.91,0:22:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.07,0:22:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.95,0:22:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toko...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.00,0:22:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.88,0:23:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seems like it will be a lovely day\Nin the Flower Capital today...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The time for Tonoyasu's \Nexecution is approaching.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.27,0:23:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Straw Hats clear away unassailable guards\Nand rush to stop the execution.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.48,0:23:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Will Tonoyasu share the fate of the cherry blossoms?!\N
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.16,0:23:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The truth behind his smile will be revealed!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.20,0:23:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"The Straw Hats Run! Save the Captive Tonoyasu!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.09,0:23:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.46,0:23:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.46,0:23:48.46,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,
